WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.931
Welcome to AroNexa for Health Store sellers. Here's a quick look around.

00:04.931 --> 00:10.501
Orders shows what patients have paid for. Confirm each order, pack it, and send it.

00:10.501 --> 00:20.424
Listings shows your products with their price, stock and status. Add a product with genuine photos and clear details. It's checked before it goes live.

00:20.424 --> 00:28.107
Performance shows on-time dispatch, returns, ratings and orders each week. That's it. Now, start exploring.
